docs-check	Boundary-unit naming ratchet	2026-09-22T11:42:00.2846278Z hdl/ieee1722/aaf/KL_chan_map_render.sv:KL_chan_map_render: map_flat_o — documented in bytes, not named for it: --- whole-map export (combinational; entry p = [p*8 +: 8]) ------------ The AEM GET_AUDIO_MAP answer walks a PAGE of entries in one query window, and the single readback port above is owned by the CSR CHMAP_SNAP path; the map is N_PHYS_P bytes of flops, so exporting it whole is wires, not logic, and keeps the two readers independent - which is exactly what lets a testbench compare them against each other.
